  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring equitable participation of all IOC Member States in IOC programmes and activities by assistance in capacity development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the 2030 Agenda will require equitable participation by all MS in IOC activities.The IOC Capacity development strategy (2015-2021) defined 6 outputs. Through 2022-2023 the CD strategy will be revised and aligned with the CD chapter of the UN Decade and related work plans of all IOC programmes will be prepared or updated to ensure that the Strategy outputs are addressed. Through specific resource mobilisation actions CD projects will be implemented in IOC regions with special attention to Africa, SIDS, LDCs and sensitive to gender and indigenous knowledge.</narrative>
  </description>
